  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Above Blood Plain, after surrounding Nian Er Ping Zhi’s sword light with vengeful ghosts, Granny Yin reveals herself, points from afar, and casts the immortal killer move Bewitching Soul Art. His eyes lose their light, the sword light form breaks into his true body, and he hangs in the air without reacting while she closes in. She is a veteran demonic path Gu Immortal who cultivates soul path and owns bewitching soul Immortal Gu.",
